<title>USA: Clayton Williams prices offer at $13/shr.</title>
<headline>Clayton Williams prices offer at $13/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clayton Williams Energy Inc said Thursday that it has priced its public offering of 1.25 million common shares $13.00 per share.  </p>
<p>The company said it would use net proceeds of the offering to reduce debt.</p>
<p>The managing underwriters for the offering are Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc and Hanifen Imhoff Inc.</p>
